      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling a profound sense of existential weight, viewing life less as a choice and more as an obligation. This feeling of being trapped in an inescapable agreement is a very heavy burden to carry. Sometimes, recognizing the structure of that burden is the first step toward finding a way to rewrite the terms of your own existence.",
